<view class="page has-tabbar">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="title">⚖️ 全局性能对比</view>
    <view class="subtitle">跨分站/多车手脚法对齐</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">对比维度</view>
    <view class="item" bindtap="onPickMode">按赛道</view>
    <view class="item-desc">同一赛道不同赛季/车手对齐</view>
    <view class="divider" />
    <view class="item" bindtap="onPickMode">按日期</view>
    <view class="item-desc">按周末日期快速回看</view>
    <view class="divider" />
    <view class="item" bindtap="onPickMode">按车手</view>
    <view class="item-desc">对比驾驶风格/刹车点</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">提示</view>
    <view class="section-desc">当前仅搭好 UI 框架与入口，后续接入后端数据后即可展示图表与 KPI。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onPickMode">开始对比</button>
  </view>
</view>
